<<~ ahu #cautions >>

!! Cautions

Name the teachers, name the adjacency, claim no authority · never cash biology as metaphysics (microchimerism grounds structure, nothing more) · the braid ships as house synthesis at Synthesis register or not at all · the Deep-Symbolic-Systems paper stays non-load-bearing (Chwe's //Rational Ritual// carries the coordination point) · ''the fifth seat stays open'' · primary pulls precede any Canon entry (Star ×3; Pukui/Handy full copies) · the adjacency-table refresh precedes the headline · the operator read never substitutes for the independence anchor.

''Owed beside the folds, tracked in the carrier itself:'' the hoike ingestion at the `findings/hoike/` seats · the Sensorium's commissioned self-measure · third-party turn-scoring · the #implications shore-model rewrite (awaiting the operator's nod).

